B.12.25 TRCRSCTLR2, Resource Selection Control Register <n>
Controls the selection of the resources in the trace unit.
Configurations
Resource selector 0 always returns FALSE.
Resource selector 1 always returns TRUE.
Resource selectors are implemented in pairs. Each odd numbered resource selector is part of a
pair with the even numbered resource selector that is numbered as one less than it. For example,
resource selectors 2 and 3 form a pair.
